zos-pascal-llvm - Free Pascal for z/OS (s390x, XPLINK-64, LLVM code generator)

Copyright (c) 2026 mms-it-ch <info@mms-it.ch>

This project is a port of Free Pascal to z/OS. It follows the licensing of
Free Pascal:

1. Everything in this repository that is not listed under 2. and 3. - the
   port run time (runtime/), the scripts (scripts/), the tests and the
   documentation - is distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public License,
   version 2.1 or (at your option) any later version (see COPYING.LGPL.txt),
   with the static linking exception of the Free Pascal run time library
   (see COPYING.FPC; "the file COPYING" mentioned there is COPYING.LGPL.txt).
   Programs linked with the port run time may therefore be distributed under
   terms of your choice.

   SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later WITH FPC-exception

2. fpc/patches/ contains changes to Free Pascal. Each change is licensed like
   the Free Pascal file it modifies:
   - compiler (compiler/): GNU General Public License, version 2 or later
     (see COPYING.GPL.txt)
   - run time library and packages (rtl/, packages/): as under 1.
     (COPYING.LGPL.txt with the exception in COPYING.FPC)

3. llvm/patches/ contains changes to LLVM. They are licensed like LLVM itself
   under the Apache License v2.0 with LLVM Exceptions
   (https://llvm.org/LICENSE.txt).

   SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception

Not part of this repository: the z/OS system headers (IBM) and other IBM
material. They are needed to build the run time but are only used from a
local copy taken from a licensed z/OS system.

